    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil forces swarm and threaten to destroy all of time. A small jumping spider must swing into action to save the past, present and future from multiversal invasion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing through levels, string together enemies, and fling yourself through time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use webs to swing around levels at breakneck speed, or shoot them to string together enemies for combo attacks. You can even manipulate the environment, flinging objects and turning hazards into deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather items across time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items from the past, present, and future, each with their own effects and synergies! Tailor your build to harness the power of space-age technology, the forces of primal evolution, or paradoxical fusions of both! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the past, present, and future</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against both prehistoric and robotic foes to defend the timeline from attack by time-spanning forces. Lead by the dubious Time Snail, join the Time Rogues in their mission to close the Time Portals and save the timeline!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil forces swarm and threaten to destroy all of time. A small jumping spider must swing into action to save the past, present and future from multiversal invasion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing through levels, string together enemies, and fling yourself through time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use webs to swing around levels at breakneck speed, or shoot them to string together enemies for combo attacks. You can even manipulate the environment, flinging objects and turning hazards into deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather items across time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items from the past, present, and future, each with their own effects and synergies! Tailor your build to harness the power of space-age technology, the forces of primal evolution, or paradoxical fusions of both! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the past, present, and future</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against both prehistoric and robotic foes to defend the timeline from attack by time-spanning forces. Lead by the dubious Time Snail, join the Time Rogues in their mission to close the Time Portals and save the timeline!</p>",
    "short_description": "Websy and the Time Rogues is an action roguelike game about swinging, battling bugs and collecting powerful items. Bouncing between the past and the future, players take control of a small jumping spider who must use their webs to defeat powerful foes from across time and space.",
